The synthetic module is slow on Dart (about 9 minutes inside the slow lane);
it is `^:slow` and guarded, so the fast lanes skip it.

## 3. Section 3.4 figures (JVM, synthetic module)

`(wide-module 1000)`: 1000 definitions, 6006 rows, 11003 occurrences.
Measured with `collab/lf_measure.clj` (never staged; run by copying it to
`test/` and `clojure -M:test -n lf-measure`, then deleting the copy).

```text
