+=========================================+===================+===================+
| publish-module! total                   | 88.4 s            | 38.7 s            |
| closure/walk                            |  6.1 s            |  4.7 s            |
| link-local :yin.ast/code                | 60.4 s            |  2.9 s            |
| link-local :yin.semantic/code           |  7.8 s            |  6.1 s            |
| link-local :yin.debruijn.code           |  8.0 s            |  5.9 s            |
