[`src/cljc/yin/repl/link.cljc`](../src/cljc/yin/repl/link.cljc):
`composition` takes `:derivation` (stored as `(or derivation :verifying)`);
`attempt` forwards it to `link-manifest`; an `:ok` response merges the
outcome's `:derivation` and `:trust` keys (present for the three lowered
